\p \v 10 \w Then Boaz said|strong="H559"\w*, “\w May the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w bless|strong="H1288"\w* \w you|strong="H859"\w*, \w my daughter|strong="H1323"\w*. \w You have shown|strong="H3190"\w* \w more kindness|strong="H2617"\w* \w now|strong="H314"\w* \w than|strong="H4480"\w* \w before|strong="H7223"\w*, \w because you have not|strong="H1115"\w* \w run|strong="H1980"\w* \w after|strong="H310"\w* \w the younger men|strong="H970"\w*, \w whether|strong="H518"\w* \w rich|strong="H6223"\w* \w or|strong="H518"\w* \w poor|strong="H1800"\w*. \v 11 \w And now|strong="H6258"\w* \w do not|strong="H408"\w* \w be afraid|strong="H3372"\w*, \w my daughter|strong="H1323"\w*. \w I will do|strong="H6213"\w* for you \w whatever|strong="H3605"\w* \w you request|strong="H559"\w*, \w since|strong="H3588"\w* \w all|strong="H3605"\w* \w my fellow townspeople|strong="H5971"\w* \w know|strong="H3045"\w* \w that|strong="H3588"\w* \w you|strong="H859"\w* \w are a woman|strong="H802"\w* \w of noble character|strong="H2428"\w*. \v 12 \w Yes|strong="H3588"\w*, \w it is true|strong="H551"\w* \w that|strong="H3588"\w* \w I am|strong="H595"\w* \w a kinsman-redeemer|strong="H1350"\w*, \w but|strong="H1571"\w* \w there is|strong="H3426"\w* \w a redeemer|strong="H1350"\w* \w nearer|strong="H7138"\w* \w than I|strong="H4480"\w*.\f + \fr 3:12 \ft That is, more closely related\f* \v 13 \w Stay here tonight|strong="H3885"\w*, \w and in the morning|strong="H1242"\w*, \w if|strong="H518"\w* \w he wants to redeem you|strong="H1350"\w*, \w good|strong="H2896"\w*. \w Let him redeem you|strong="H1350"\w*. \w But if|strong="H518"\w* \w he does not|strong="H3808"\w* \w want|strong="H2654"\w* \w to redeem you|strong="H1350"\w*, \w as surely as the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w lives|strong="H2416"\w*, \w I|strong="H595"\w* \w will|strong="H1350"\w*. \w Now lie here|strong="H7901"\w* \w until|strong="H5704"\w* \w morning|strong="H1242"\w*.”
